Z||000010||Monkeyman||02-19-2000||02:43 AM||||batboy--The seller dropped the price $100 from his original $500.  I've been making payments (you've heard how money's been with me lately) so I still owe him $50 which I'll give him when I pick the car up.  Another forum member has graciously offered to provide a tow vehicle so we'll be picking it up as soon as he is able and the weather breaks.  Hopefully within the next month.  I can't wait!  I'm psyched!||||reg||1
Z||000011||stimpy||02-19-2000||09:30 AM||||WT3, I have a question. Isn't retrofitting the Performance Sound a huge undertaking? I thought that it pretty much meant removing almost all of the interior? Not to question your wisdom, but why bother? The sound coming out of the factory "subwoofer" is pretty hideous in quality. (IMO) You can get much better sound out of using high end speakers in the stock locations with a good amplifier. <BR>If it is to increase collector cachet, wouldn't it make a difference to a colloector that the option is not original?<BR>Like I said, don;t want to start an argument, maybe just spare someone from tearing the crap out of their fiero interior only to be disappointd with the result.  ||||reg||5
