Z||000017||ChadMan||02-19-2000||11:21 AM||||Thanks for talking some sense into me, you guys.  I go looking at Fieros and it's like visiting the dog pound...you just want to give them all a good home.  If the paint were all that were wrong with this GT, it would be worth the $2K, but with all the other problems, you're right - $1K tops.<P>William, I'm definitely interested in your GT and will email you later today.<P>Thanks for all the responses!||||reg||10
